  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0419.goetes.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0419.goetes.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0419.goetes.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0419_goetes"><head>ΓΟΗΤΕΣ</head><pb n="732" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.hxjhbd:scan:750" />
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0419-goetes-1">
              <head>I.</head>
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0419-goetes-1-l1">Παντευχίαν δὲ τοῦ θεοῦ ταύτην λαβεῖν</l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0419-goetes-1-l2">καὶ περίθετον πρόσωπον, ὃ λαβὼν ἕσταθι.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">Scholiasta Aristoph. Thesm. 258: λέγουσι δὲ περίθετον πρόσωπον, ὡς <bibl>Ἀριστομένης ἐν Γόησιν</bibl>
                <quote>Παντευχίαν κτλ.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Vs. 1 malim δεῖ pro δέ. — Vs. 3 legebatur ἔνσταθι. Cfr Hist. crit. p. 212.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0419-goetes-2">
              <head>II.</head>
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0419-goetes-2-l1">Ὀστακὸν</l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0419-goetes-2-l2">ἁλίπαστον ἀεὶ τὸν θεράποντ᾽ ἀπεσθίειν.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus XIV p. 658 a: ἁλιπάστων κρεῶν μνημονεύει ὁ τῆς κωμῳδίας ποιητὴς <bibl>Ἀριστομένης — ἐν Γόησιν</bibl>
                <quote>Ὀστακὸν κτλ.</quote>
              </note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0419-goetes-3">
              <head>III.</head>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus VII p. 287 d: Ἀττικοὶ δὲ ὅμως βεμβράδας λέγουσιν. <bibl>Ἀριστομένης ἐν Γόησι</bibl>
                <quote>
                  <lg>
                    <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0419-goetes-3-l1">Βεμβράδας φέρων</l>
                    <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0419-goetes-3-l2">ὀβολοῦ.</l>
                  </lg>
                </quote>
              </note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0419-goetes-4">
              <head>IV.</head>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus IX p. 384 d: ἀναβραστῶν δὲ κρεῶν μνημονεύει <bibl>Ἀριστομένης Γόησιν</bibl> οὕτως.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Aristomenis χρῆσις excidit.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0419-goetes-5">
              <head>V.</head>
              <note type="source">Pollux VII 211: καὶ βιβλιοπώλην μὲν παρὰ <bibl>Ἀριστομένει εὑρήσεις ἐν Γόησι</bibl>, βιβλιογράφον δὲ παρὰ Κρατίνῳ ἐν Χείρωσι.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Cfr Lobeckius ad Phryn. p. 655.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="6" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0419-goetes-6">
              <head>VI.</head>
              <note type="source">Harpocratio p. 182 13: ὅτι καὶ ἐπ᾿ ἀνθρωπείου δέρματος ἐλέγετο ἡ φορίνη, καὶ <bibl>Ἀριστομένης ἐν Γόησι</bibl> δῆλον ποιεῖ.</note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>